[statement]
A removal that waits on removals needing it through a name it provides at
no version, or through a condition, has them removed first, at its own
place in the installed database: `sh` provides `/bin/sh`, which `ice`
needs; apk removes `ice` and then `sh`, both before `k`, which the
database lists after them.

[repository]
P:x
V:1

[installed]
P:sh
V:1
p:/bin/sh

P:ice
V:1
D:/bin/sh

P:k
V:1

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove ice 1
remove sh 1
remove k 1
install x 1
